 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What happens after the 7-day free trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Your plan auto-charges on Day 8 unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the trial ends. We send email reminders at T-3, T-1, and T-0 so you always know what's coming."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Is a credit card required to start the trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes — your card is saved securely via a Stripe Setup Intent (PCI-DSS Level 1). No charge is placed until Day 8, and you can cancel any time from Billing settings."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Can I switch plans mid-trial?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes. Upgrades and downgrades are available anytime from Billing settings. Any charges are prorated based on remaining days in the cycle."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What's the refund policy?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee on your first paid month, no questions asked. Contact support and we'll process the refund within 3 business days."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"What does \"equity in lieu of cash\" mean?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Enterprise-tier customers may negotiate paying part of their subscription (typically 5–10%) via equity through a separate off-platform legal agreement. All equity arrangements are subject to counsel review — Request a Call to discuss terms."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Do digital shares issued via BlockID count as real securities?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"No. Digital shares on BlockID are cap-table records mirrored to a blockchain for tamper-evidence and audit trail. Your ASIC register remains the source of truth. Any securities-adjacent workflow is flagged for legal review before execution."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"How do you handle GST?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"For Australian customers, 10% GST is added at checkout once we cross the A$75K annual turnover threshold. Tax is calculated and split automatically via Stripe Tax and appears on your itemized invoice."]],["DETAILS",{"class":"lux-card group p-6 open:border-brand-gold/30 transition-colors"},["SUMMARY",{"class":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan"},["H3",{"class":"text-base md:text-lg font-medium text-brand-gold pr-2"},"Can I switch segment (e.g., from Founder to Investor)?"],["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"mt-1 flex-shrink-0 h-6 w-6 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/40 text-brand-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"},"+"]],["P",{"class":"mt-4 text-sm md:text-base text-brand-ink-muted leading-relaxed"},"Yes. Switching segment triggers a short re-onboarding step to configure the right dashboards and workflows. For enterprise multi-tenant setups (running multiple segments in one account), contact support."]]],["P",{"class":"mt-10 text-center text-xs text-brand-ink-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto"},"Information provided on this page is general in nature and does not constitute financial, legal, or tax advice. Consult a licensed professional before making decisions about securities, equity, or tax treatment. BlockID.au is operated by Auschain PTY LTD (ACN 659 615 111)."]]]],["SECTION",{"aria-labelledby":"_S_1_","class":"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-3xl border border-[var(--fintech-border)] bg-[var(--fintech-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-10"},["P",{"class":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--fintech-accent)]"},"Enterprise"],["H2",{"id":"_S_1_","class":"mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--fintech-ink)] sm:text-3xl"},"Need custom pricing or equity-in-lieu?"],["DIV",{"class":"mt-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-start gap-6 text-center sm:items-center"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-b